{"title":"Saw","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Crafted (Tool Smithing Lv 12)</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      <p><b>Crafted</b> with Tool Smithing at level 12 <span class=\"muted\">(217 XP)</span> from 3× <a href=\"#/item/iron-bar\">Iron Bar</a>, 1× <a href=\"#/item/pine-wood\">Pine Wood</a>.</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/tool-smithing\">Tool smithing</a></p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p><b>A tool for</b> Carpentry. Better metal and quality raise its bonus: see the skill guide’s tool box.</p><p class=\"rel-row\"><b>Other materials</b> <a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/silver-saw\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/gen/e53b59f1473c52a0d8a6.svg\" alt=\"\">Silver Saw</a><a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/gold-saw\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/gen/fcf8474f0bf96c343c4a.svg\" alt=\"\">Gold Saw</a><a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/titanium-saw\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/gen/737a960d7860f382a411.svg\" alt=\"\">Titanium Saw</a></p><p class=\"rel-row\"><b>Made from</b> <a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/iron-bar\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/gen/fcaf756b47ad17904f61.svg\" alt=\"\">Iron Bar</a><a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/pine-wood\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/gen/c1da01d099b56c842ef6.svg\" alt=\"\">Pine Wood</a></p>\n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/gen/6d517b5446e8b565e04c.svg\" alt=\"Saw\"></div><h3>Saw</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Made with</th><td>Tool Smithing 12</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n    </table></aside></article>"}